WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.235
-Here's how it works.

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.503
Each shot sits on a coaster

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.572
that has a personal question
written on it. Okay.

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:07.540
You'll read the question
silently,

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.876
but you'll give your
answer out loud.

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.711
Then you'll have to choose
whether to share

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:14.246
what the question was,
or can you take the shot,

00:00:14.246 --> 00:00:15.681
and keep it a secret.

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:17.350
However you must reveal at least
one question

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.917
during the course
of the game.

00:00:18.917 --> 00:00:21.287
Tonight, America's finally going
to get all the answers,

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:22.955
just not all of the questions.

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:24.690
You ready to play?
-Yes.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.225
-Alright, here you go. Kendall,
you go first with this one.

00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:27.593
-Starting here?
-Yeah,

00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:28.928
